  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div style=\"background-color:#280033;border-radius:35px;\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;gap:20px;padding:10px;border-radius:35px;background:#520044;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;gap:20px;align-items:center;justify-content:flex-start\">\n<div style=\"align-items: center; border-radius: 25px; display: flex; justify-content: center; height: 50px; overflow: hidden; width: 50px; border: 2px solid #000; background-color: #66d7ff;\"> <img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/69260335-4a3c-4be0-8ae6-391421982ff5/thumbnail/width/60/height/60\" alt=\"60\" />\n</div>\n<div><span style=\"font-family:Broadway;font-size:20pt;color:#ffc500\">Zacatero</span>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#ffc500;color:#1e0c1b;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:5px;font-size:12px;font-family:rubik, roboto, arial, sans-serif;font-weight:700;line-height:1.5;vertical-align:text-bottom\"><a href=\"https://community.fandom.com/wiki/Help:SOAP\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Help:SOAP\"><span style=\"color:Black\">SOAP</span></a></div><div style=\"background:#ffc500;color:#1e0c1b;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:5px;font-size:12px;font-family:rubik, roboto, arial, sans-serif;font-weight:700;line-height:1.5;vertical-align:text-bottom\"><a href=\"https://community.fandom.com/wiki/Help:Fandom_Stars\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Help:Fandom Stars\"><span style=\"color:Black\">Fandom Star</span></a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"border-radius:25px;height:50px;width:100px;display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;padding:0;cursor:pointer;user-select:none;--wds-primary-button-background-color: #ffc500; --wds-primary-button-background-color--hover:#c29600;color:#1e0c1b\" class=\"wds-button mw-customtoggle-wikis\"><span>wikis</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-wikis\"><div style=\"padding:10px;text-align:center;color:#e6e6e6\"><a href=\"https://hellskitchen.fandom.com/wiki/\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:hellskitchen\"><span style=\"color:#ffc500\">Hell's Kitchen Wiki</span></a> &#8226; <a href=\"https://avatar.fandom.com/wiki/\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:avatar\"><span style=\"color:#ffc500\">Avatar Wiki</span></a> &#8226; <a href=\"https://dev.fandom.com/wiki/\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:dev\"><span style=\"color:#ffc500\">Dev Wiki</span></a> &#8226; <a href=\"https://community.fandom.com/wiki/\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:community\"><span style=\"color:#ffc500\">Community Central</span></a> &#8226; <a href=\"https://soap.fandom.com/wiki/\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:soap\"><span style=\"color:#ffc500\">SOAP Wiki</span></a></div></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display:grid;gap:30px;grid-template-columns: 5fr 4fr;grid-template-rows:auto 1fr auto;margin-top:30px;grid-template-areas:&#39;desc lang&#39; &#39;desc contact&#39; &#39;desc stuff&#39;\">\n<div style=\"background-color:#cf721c;color:#e6e6e6;font-size:13pt;font-family:roboto;border-radius:25px;padding:25px;position:relative;grid-area:desc\">\nHello!! I first joined Fandom in December of 2016, although I really started editing heavily in November of 2019 on the Hell's Kitchen Wiki.<br /><br />You will usually find me on the <a href=\"https://hellskitchen.fandom.com/wiki/\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:hellskitchen\"><span style=\"color:#753369;\"><b>Hell's Kitchen Wiki</b></span></a> or the <a href=\"https://avatar.fandom.com/wiki/\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:avatar\"><span style=\"color:#753369;\"><b>Avatar Wiki</b></span></a>, although you may find me everywhere around Fandom <a href=\"https://community.fandom.com/wiki/Community_Central:Community_Volunteers#SOAP_(Spam_Obliteration_&amp;_Prevention)\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Community Central:Community Volunteers\"><span style=\"color:#753369;\"><b>reverting vandalism</b></span></a> as a member of the <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://community.fandom.com/SOAP\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/central/images/3/32/Soapgrouplogo.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20\" alt=\"20\" /></a></span>&#160;<b><a href=\"https://community.fandom.com/wiki/SOAP\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:SOAP\"><span style=\"color:white\">SOAP</span></a></b> team or assisting communities as a member of the <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://community.fandom.com/Help:Vanguard\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/central/images/f/fd/Vanguard.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20\" alt=\"20\" /></a></span>&#160;<b><a href=\"https://community.fandom.com/wiki/Vanguard\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Vanguard\"><span style=\"color:white\">Vanguard</span></a></b> team. <span style=\"position:absolute;left:30px;top:-20px;background-color:#ffc500;font-size:16px;padding:2px 5px;border-radius:10px;font-family:rubik, roboto, arial, sans-serif;color:#1e0c1b;font-weight:500;\">About</span></div>\n<div style=\"background-color:#cf721c;color:white;font-size:12pt;border-radius:25px;padding:25px;position:relative;display:flex;gap:10px\"><div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><i>\"Your boos mean nothing, I've seen what makes you cheer!\"</i><br />~ <a href=\"https://rickandmorty.fandom.com/wiki/Rick_Sanchez\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:rickandmorty:Rick Sanchez\"><span style=\"color:#753369;\"><b>Rick Sanchez</b></span></a>\n</p>\n<p><!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261119205958\nCache expiry: 10816\nReduced expiry: true\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.003 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.004 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 15/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 330/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 byte